web - This is a web server process — Railway exposes it to the internet
uvicorn - The server that runs FastAPI apps
 main:appLook in main.py, find the variable called app (your FastAPI instance)
--host 0.0.0.0Accept connections from ANY IP address — not just localhost
--port $PORTUse whatever port Railway assigns — Railway sets this automatically -->
